    <CHAPTER cnumber="91">
      <VERS vnumber="1"> He that <gr str="3427">dwelleth </gr>in the secret <gr str="5643">place </gr>of the most <gr str="5945">High </gr>shall <gr str="3885">abide </gr>under the <gr str="6738">shadow </gr>of the <gr str="7706">Almighty</gr>. </VERS>
